# Arena mail

Cross-session prompts and talk go through git branch `mail/<task>`, never through paste between chats.

Use only:

```text
scripts/arena prompt pack --task ID --to ROLE
scripts/arena prompt next --task ID --me ROLE
scripts/arena prompt send --task ID --from ROLE --to ROLE --type TYPE --body TEXT
```

Allowed types: `arena-ready`, `pack`, `question`, `reply`, `result`, `rubric-q`, `rubric-a`.

- `prompt next` is the session's incoming prompt. Do not wait for the human to paste a brief.
- Tracker → O2 mid-run: only `rubric-q` (clarify TASK/RUBRIC boundaries). No "how should I implement X".
- O2 `rubric-a`: restates constraints. No solution hints.
- Tracker → O2 for scoring: only sealed `result` after work is committed.
- Trackers do not message each other. O1 may relay a sanitized excerpt.
